<title>THAILAND: Thai Airways yr net rises 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Thai Airways yr net rises 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.42     vs	    2.31</p>
<p>    Net		    3,383.33     vs	3,235.93</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Thai Airways International Plc, the Thai national carrier.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
</text>
